From 90ff6762bc35b1981f3463bd5fa6b6277d3cf4cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Unleashed <codex-unleashed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 04:20:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: Compare feedback cwd with the selected thread workspace

The remote fixture owns a separate host temporary directory. Verify the configured thread cwd and reject the daemon fallback while keeping automatic remote environment selection. Historical remote failure compares these unrelated directories; corrected runtime remains to be verified.
---
 .../app-server/src/request_processors/feedback_processor.rs    | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/codex-rs/app-server/src/request_processors/feedback_processor.rs b/codex-rs/app-server/src/request_processors/feedback_processor.rs
index f3f20719..806403e4 100644
--- a/codex-rs/app-server/src/request_processors/feedback_processor.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/app-server/src/request_processors/feedback_processor.rs
@@ -555,5 +555,6 @@ mod tests {
         .await;

-        assert_eq!(cwd, test.cwd_path());
+        assert_eq!(cwd, test.config.cwd.as_path());
+        assert_ne!(cwd, daemon_workspace.path());
         Ok(())
     }
